To represent the caring character of pet care services, I decided on a warm and inviting visual approach for the "Pet Care" website design. The background image of a woman holding her dog conveys trust and emotional connection instantly, which is essential for pet care companies. While keeping the calming tone, the semi-transparent content panels and gentle blue backdrop guarantee readability. White, light blue, and a hint of gray are used to convey a sense of warmth, professionalism, and cleanliness.

The layout is set up to provide users with simple instruction. The "Get Started" call-to-action and the visible welcome message immediately draw attention to user participation, while the top navigation bar provides simple access to the key pages (Home, About Us, and Feedback). Below that, the services (training, veterinary, and grooming) are arranged in distinct areas with "Book Now" buttons and brief descriptions to make sure users can get what they need fast.  Both visual appeal and user convenience are given top priority in this arrangement.